2026-07-27T10:04:31.1754271Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:04:31.1754752Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:04:31.1755436Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:04:31.1756497Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:04:31.1757798Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
